pe of Nakewameke called a Nakisakebe, but also harm her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-06-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qM7CmLe8o1zsDmuY2ILru5q18nO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qM7CmLe8o1zsDmuY2ILru5q18nO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46128/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"907398","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After exhausting themselves training for a dance competition, the Cures must choose between dancing and their duties as Pretty Cures.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-06-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mzHEloXJk3i3SzYZTPGzUcGwaEe.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mzHEloXJk3i3SzYZTPGzUcGwaEe.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46128/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"907375","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The night before the dance competition, the girls are hospitalized due to fatigue. Tarte becomes desperate to find the fourth member of Pretty Cure. He approaches Miyuki and begs her to join.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-06-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1bq7lEoC5acTeFvO3y20m0TYAU1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1bq7lEoC5acTeFvO3y20m0TYAU1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/46128/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"907405","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The girls believe that Miyuki is the fourth Pretty Cure and search for Akarun. However, they run into Eas again, who reveals her identity as Setsuna."